Z||000005||Taijiguy||07-18-2000||09:04 AM||||You didn't say if it would turn over but just not start. If it turns over but won't catch, check to make sure you didn't somehow interrupt the wiring to the fuel pump rely at the fuse block. <P>Good luck!<BR>-Taiji||||reg||1
